{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36977","headline":"圣真观刘真师院十韵 · 罗隐","name":"圣真观刘真师院十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帘下严君卜，窗间少室峰。\n摄生门已尽，混迹世犹逢。\n山薮师王烈，簪缨友戴顒。\n鱼跳介象鱠，饭吐葛玄蜂。\n紫饱垂新椹，黄轻堕小松。\n尘埃金谷路，楼阁上阳钟。\n野耗鸢肩寄，仙书鸟爪封。\n支牀龟纵老，取箭鹤何慵。\n别久曾牵念，闲来肯压重。\n尚余青竹在，试爲剪成龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}